{"overview":"کویومی آراراگی، دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی، به‌طور مداوم با دخترانی که به بیماری‌های فراطبیعی «عجیب» مبتلا هستند، روبه‌رو می‌شود. او تمام تلاش خود را می‌کند تا به آن‌ها کمک کند، اغلب با کمک متخصص عجیب و غریب، میم اوشینو. هر بخش دربارهٔ مبارزهٔ منحصر به فرد یک دختر و علت مرموز ابتلا به‌اش صحبت می‌کند. این سریال به موضوعات نوجوانی، رشد شخصی و پیچیدگی‌های روابط انسانی می‌پردازد و به خاطر دیالوگ‌های هوشمند، انیمیشن‌های سبک و ساختار روایت منحصر به‌فردش شناخته شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Koyomi Araragi, a high school student, finds himself constantly encountering girls afflicted by supernatural \"oddities.\" He dedicates himself to helping them, often with the aid of the eccentric specialist Meme Oshino. Each arc talks about a different girl's unique struggle and the mysterious cause of their affliction. The series explores themes of adolescence, personal growth, and the complexities of human relationships. It's known for its witty dialogue, stylistic animation, and unique narrative structure.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":49,"y":2009,"poster":"/qfyqDAuERlN2afs8f56or1jSALn.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2009,"poster":"/qfyqDAuERlN2afs8f56or1jSALn.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":11,"y":2012,"poster":"/hbLt05yzOMhvV4OcQzmhciFr3Fh.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2013,"poster":"/z0GPizkLzcx2pmyXJJQewg8EvhC.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/xn2mGKbYX2SniGoI6iDmi07CMB1.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":15,"y":2024,"poster":"/gUQPpTYCZ18JpCKVFRIX1j4l8s1.jpg"}],"episodes":73,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"神谷浩史","role":"Koyomi Araragi (voice)","photo":"/5aAAOlQ2hW5EqEQOzk4UeroxcTN.jpg","en":"Hiroshi Kamiya"},{"name":"斎藤千和","role":"Hitagi Senjougahara (voice)","photo":"/jxWuA4K0ZPkOQMeIgLlzaHSkgiV.jpg","en":"Chiwa Saito"},{"name":"堀江由衣","role":"Tsubasa Hanekawa / Black Hanekawa (voice)","photo":"/73yQlMWaiOMrhvPCNyOCbbCkILZ.jpg","en"